  "item_short_desc": "<p>Experience superior performance with Rothco's 8-Inch Forced Entry Waterproof Tactical Boot. Designed for everyday use and tactical needs, this rugged boot combines cutting-edge features. The moisture-wicking and waterproof technology, along with a gusseted tongue, ensures all-day comfort and protection. With a waterproof leather outer material, rust-proof hardware, and a slip-resistant cup sole, this boot delivers durability and stability in any environment. The speed laces with rustproof hardware make for quick adjustments.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "6143",
  "description": "<p>Experience superior performance with Rothco's 8-Inch Forced Entry Waterproof Tactical Boot. Designed for everyday use and tactical needs, this rugged boot combines cutting-edge features. The moisture-wicking and waterproof technology, along with a gusseted tongue, ensures all-day comfort and protection. With a waterproof leather outer material, rust-proof hardware, and a slip-resistant cup sole, this boot delivers durability and stability in any environment. The speed laces with rustproof hardware make for quick adjustments, while the steel shank provides added support. Elevate your tactical gear with this reliable and versatile waterproof boot.&nbsp; Designed with precision and built to withstand the harshest conditions, Rothco's collection of footwear and accessories combines durability, functionality, and unparalleled performance. From our Forced Entry Series which features our speedlace and waterproof technologies, to our V-Max Collection designed with lightweight running shoe soles, our diverse range of footwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, Rothco is the go-to brand for all things that keep you standing on your feet.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
